@HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### List heroes
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/heroes
Accept: application/json

### Top counter-picks against Anti-Mage, ranked by sample-adjusted advantage; limit is 1-20
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/counters?against=1&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Against a lineup (Anti-Mage and Pudge): one "against" per enemy, up to five
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/counters?against=1&against=14
Accept: application/json

### Leaving out heroes that can't be picked, such as your own team's (Crystal Maiden): one "exclude" each, up to five
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/counters?against=1&against=14&exclude=5
Accept: application/json

### Only supports: one role, case-insensitive (Carry, Support, Nuker, Disabler, ...)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/counters?against=1&against=14&role=Support
Accept: application/json

### Your team (Meepo, Lion) against the enemy lineup: each hero's edge per enemy, plus the team's total
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/team-matchup?team=82&team=26&against=1&against=14
Accept: application/json

### Health: "Healthy" (200) when the database is reachable, "Unhealthy" (503) otherwise
GET {{HostAddress}}/health
